NAME
    gcloud apihub discovered-api-observations discovered-api-operations -
        manage Discovered Api Operation resources

SYNOPSIS
    gcloud apihub discovered-api-observations discovered-api-operations COMMAND
        [GCLOUD_WIDE_FLAG ...]

DESCRIPTION
    Manage Discovered Api Operation resources.

GCLOUD WIDE FLAGS
    These flags are available to all commands: --help.

    Run $ gcloud help for details.

COMMANDS
    COMMAND is one of the following:

     describe
        Describe a Discovered Api Operation.

     list
        List Discovered Api Operations.

NOTES
    This variant is also available:

        $ gcloud alpha apihub discovered-api-observations \
            discovered-api-operations

